{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨日張雪發視頻宣佈將在22日的嘉年華活動中，拍賣53號冠軍賽車，「拍賣所得所有款項我們全部用於資助中國小車手成長」。他表示，此前曾許諾將真實賽車拍賣款捐給某慈善基金會，但「後面發生了一些事情，我內心是有些質疑的」，因此説明前面的許諾失效。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585898.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:45:17.960657+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:13:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.604328+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.604328+00:00","content_hash":"25200a6cb3950b1cb6620770dca6c33804e83e0f2fa5c7c03eca7d645f6b6a12","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}